+Generated using the built-in image generation tool. All images generated fresh from text, with no reference images.
+
+## 305-rousseau.png
+
+Generate one fresh 1024x1024 square image from text only. Use case: stylized-concept, standalone fine-art painting. Henri Rousseau naive jungle painting. Dense stylized leaves and precisely delineated tropical fronds fill a flattened, dreamlike jungle beneath a full moon, a tiger peeking out among the plants. Wide tableau with the woman shown seated full body, small among enormous layered leaves, calmly enjoying a cup of coffee with a croissant nearby. The woman is in her early 30s, with curly auburn shoulder-length hair, freckles, round tortoiseshell glasses, and a mustard-yellow knit sweater. Flat precise naive oil-painted rendering, deliberately awkward anatomy and flattened perspective, clear silhouettes, patterned leaves, deep greens, moonlit blue and earthy warm accents. The style dictates anatomy, pose, setting, composition, lighting, and paint handling. An authentic naive painting, not a photograph with a filter. No text, captions, signatures, watermarks, borders or lettering. Use no reference image.
+
+## 306-grant-wood.png
+
+Generate one fresh 1024x1024 square image from text only. Use case: stylized-concept, standalone fine-art painting. Grant Wood American regionalism. A woman in her early 30s with curly auburn shoulder-length hair, freckles, round tortoiseshell glasses, and a mustard-yellow knit sweater poses stiffly and frontally in a waist-up portrait, holding a coffee cup ceremonially instead of a pitchfork, her quiet contentment suggesting she is savoring her coffee. A croissant rests nearby on the foreground ledge. Behind her a farmhouse and smooth rounded rolling agricultural hills. American Gothic-like formal rigidity, elongated stylized face, exact crisp contours, smooth meticulously painted surfaces, sculptural modeled shapes, repeating rounded hill rhythms, restrained ochres and greens, lucid rural daylight. Grant Wood painting logic determines proportions, anatomy, framing, lighting and setting; authentic American regionalist painting, no photographic realism or photo filter. No text, captions, signatures, watermarks, borders or lettering. Use no reference image.
+
+## 307-pollock.png
+
+Generate a fresh 1024x1024 square fine-art image from text only, no reference images. Mid-century abstract expressionist drip painting: wild, rhythmic tangles of poured paint, splattered enamel, thin looping filaments, thick interwoven skeins, little spatters and exposed canvas. Restrict the paint palette to black, white, mustard and auburn. Physical paint texture and rich layered gestural complexity across the whole square; no single center of attention and no conventional perspective. Make the painting almost wholly nonfigurative. Buried deep in the chaos are very faint, fragmentary suggestions of a woman in her early 30s enjoying a cup of coffee, with a croissant nearby. Her curly auburn shoulder-length hair is suggested by curling auburn paint strings; freckles by tiny spatter; round tortoiseshell glasses by two interrupted brown loops; a mustard-yellow knit sweater by tangles of mustard filaments. The coffee cup and croissant emerge only as fleeting accidental curves. There is no complete portrait, no solid face, no fully delineated anatomy. The figure is barely emerging from the energy, readable only through abstract associations after careful looking. An authentic all-over action painting with paint-generated shapes, not a figurative image with a splatter filter. No text, captions, signatures, watermark or border.
+
+## 308-murakami.png
+
+Generate one fresh 1024x1024 square image from text only. Use case: stylized-concept, standalone pop-art illustration. Takashi Murakami superflat: flat glossy anime-pop, smiling rainbow flowers everywhere, bright saturated candy colors, perfectly uniform outline width, crisp immaculate hard edges and flat solid-color shapes without volumetric shading. Exuberant, cute character with huge sparkling eyes, playful radically stylized adult chibi anatomy, oversized head, tiny body, frothy simplified auburn curls. The woman is in her early 30s with shoulder-length curly auburn hair, freckles, round tortoiseshell glasses, mustard-yellow knit sweater. She floats diagonally through a tightly packed field of smiling rainbow flower faces, happily drinking coffee from a tiny cup, a stylized croissant hovering nearby. Cropped flower heads at every edge and dizzying scale shifts, joyful graphic motifs, dense saturated surface with absolutely flat depth. Style fully dictates anatomy, framing, pose, palette and medium. Authentic superflat pop composition, no photographic realism, no photo filter, no 3D rendering, no variable brush outlines. No text, captions, signatures, watermarks, borders or lettering. Use no reference image.
+

